---
<ProductLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="/images/dinweys-brown-flaxseed-1024x1024.jpg" gallery={gallery} category={category} price={price} related={related} descriptionHtml={`<p>Northern Hebei, China, is one of the traditional flaxseed production areas. Due to its favorable geographic conditions for cultivation, flaxseed from Hebei is particularly well-suited for the production and processing of high-end flaxseed oil, roasted flaxseed powder, and flaxseed edible gum.</p><p>Dinweys supplies good-quality Bulk Brown Flaxseed for you.</p><h2>Product Details</h2><table border="1" cellpadding="10" width="680"><tbody><tr><th colspan="2">Brown Flaxseed</th></tr><tr><td><b>Botanical Name</b></td><td><i>Linum usitatissimum Linn.</i></td></tr><tr><td><b>Processing Part</b></td><td>Seeds</td></tr><tr><td><b>Raw Material Source</b></td><td>China</td></tr><tr><td><b>Origin</b></td><td>Hebei China</td></tr><tr><td><b>Issue Date</b></td><td>April 8, 2024</td></tr><tr><td><b>Product Code</b></td><td>DYFS-01</td></tr><tr><th colspan="2">Physicochemical Indicators</th></tr><tr><td><b>Appearance</b></td><td>Oval-shaped seeds</td></tr><tr><td><b>Taste and Smell</b></td><td>Characteristic flaxseed odor</td></tr><tr><td><b>Texture</b></td><td>Hard</td></tr><tr><td><b>Purity (%)</b></td><td>≥99.9</td></tr><tr><td><b>Moisture (%)</b></td><td>≤9</td></tr><tr><td><b>Ash (%)</b></td><td>≤5</td></tr><tr><th colspan="2">Microbiological Testing</th></tr><tr><td><b>Escherichia coli (cfu/g)</b></td><td>&lt;25,000</td></tr><tr><td><b>Bacillus cereus (cfu/g)</b></td><td>&lt;50</td></tr><tr><td><b>Salmonella</b></td><td>Not detectable in 25g</td></tr><tr><td><b>Yeasts and Molds (cfu/g)</b></td><td>&lt;5,000</td></tr><tr><td><b>Aflatoxin (ppb)</b></td><td>&lt;4</td></tr><tr><td><b>Ochratoxin (ppb)</b></td><td>&lt;4</td></tr><tr><th colspan="2">Nutritional Content per 100g</th></tr><tr><td><b>Energy (kj)</b></td><td>2100</td></tr><tr><td><b>Energy (kcal)</b></td><td>500</td></tr><tr><td><b>Protein (g)</b></td><td>20.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Carbohydrates (g)</b></td><td>34.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Sugars (g)</b></td><td>1.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Fats (g)</b></td><td>36.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Saturated Fatty Acids (g)</b></td><td>3.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Monounsaturated Fatty Acids (g)</b></td><td>6.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Polyunsaturated Fatty Acids (g)</b></td><td>27.9</td></tr><tr><th colspan="2">Packaging and Storage</th></tr><tr><td><b>Packaging</b></td><td>25 kg / triple-layer paper packaging or 50 kg/bag</td></tr><tr><td><b>Storage</b></td><td>Store in a cool, dry place away from light</td></tr><tr><td><b>Shelf Life</b></td><td>18 months from harvest</td></tr><tr><th colspan="2">Additional Information</th></tr><tr><td><b>Grade</b></td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td><b>Impurities (%)</b></td><td>≤1.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Moisture (%)</b></td><td>≤10.0</td></tr><tr><td><b>Net Kernel Rate (%)</b></td><td>≥99.9</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Product Certifications</strong>:</h3><p>ISO9001 and ISO22000 (HACCP) dual quality system certification, EU organic certification (ECO), USDA organic certification, and China organic certification (OFDC).</p>`} />
